      "writtenOn": "2022-11-18T06:46:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just checking for mModemCount is not going to help with the race condition.\n\nInstead, I simply opted for replacing the int[] with a SparseIntArray which clears the relevant entries as the callbacks are unregistered. This should guarantee that the array always has the latest service UID sent by the latest callback, and allows simplifying the code further.\n\nThis still doesn\u0027t work if there are race conditions in telephony where an *old* callback is called after a new one in spite of it being already unregistered. If that happens it should be fixed in telephony though – if it happens on older platforms we could also address it with generation IDs but I don\u0027t think it\u0027s necessary here.",
